#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Desktop widget for Claude Code usage.

Sits on the wallpaper like the Grok usage bar: no title bar, under other
windows, fixed just above that bar. It starts with the session.

Reads the Claude Code login in ~/.claude/.credentials.json. An access token
inside five minutes of expiresAt is renewed with the stored refresh token,
under the same ~/.claude/.oauth_refresh.lock directory Claude Code uses, and
the new session is written back. Usage comes from the endpoint Claude Code's
/usage view calls:

    GET https://api.anthropic.com/api/oauth/usage

The card shows the 5-hour session window and the 7-day window. Refreshes
every 10 minutes.
"""

